<title>MEXICO: Mexico's TIIE 28-day rate falls to 28.5250 pct.</title>
<headline>Mexico's TIIE 28-day rate falls to 28.5250 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's 28-day interbank interest rate on Friday fell by 57.50 basis points to 28.525 percent from 29.10 percent the previous day, Banco de Mexico said.</p>
<p>The TIIE is a market-weighted average interbank rate, which is revised daily.</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9558))</p>
